      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_langevin_dynamics_samples_posterior",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
      "text": "Langevin dynamics samples that posterior accurately, but runs a fresh chain of iterations per data point and converges slowly, so it has rarely been practical.",
      "box": [
