      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_variational_inference_dominates_than",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
      "text": "Variational inference dominates thanks to amortization: a shared encoder predicts the latents for all data, like the variational autoencoder.",
